EW API FORMATTED COMMENT
TYPE LIBRARY

LIBRARY  EWDB_APPLICATIONS

SUB_LIBRARY ora2snippet_gif

LOCATION THIS_FILE

LINK_NAME Details
LINK details.html

LINK_NAME Sample Config File
LINK ora2snippet_gif.d.txt

LINK_NAME Programmer Notes
LINK programmer_notes.txt

DESCRIPTION <b>ora2snippet_gif</b> generates a web-page
displaying snippets from an Event as record sections
in GIF format.
<br>
There are config file parameters that control which
traces are displayed, how the traces are aligned, how
long the display is, and many other properties that 
will probably never change from the defaults.  Please see 
the <a href = details.html>details page </a> and the 
<a href = ora2snippet_gif.d.txt> sample config file</a>
for more detailed information.

